	<a name="examples"></a>
	<h3>Examples</h3>

	<p>Evaluate a closure named <code>patient-problems</code> for a subset of SNOMED CT.</p>

	<a name="req"> </a>
	<h4>Request:</h4>
	<pre class="http"><code>POST [base]/$closure</code></pre>
	<pre class="json"><code>{% include closure-request.json %}</code></pre>

	<a name="resp"> </a>
	<h4>Response:</h4>
	<pre class="http"><code>HTTP/1.1 200 OK
[other headers]</code></pre>
	<pre class="json"><code>{% include closure-response.json %}</code></pre>
